    "Sorted range7, largest rank6: trace[7,3,1], scan11, two edges while clog2(7)=3; anticipated charge111.",
    "Sorted four-element list, requested lower median rank1: early equal stop at initial4, scan4, zero edges, actual charge39.",
    "Same four-element list, rank0: actual lower branch to singleton0, trace[4,1], scan5, actual charge57.",
